# A Quickshell config run by its path (#321): `qs -p PATH`, `quickshell -p PATH`. `key value` lines,
# crates/omabox/src/deskshell.rs says the keys; {path} is any one word. No config line: the path is
# the user's own folder, wherever it is.
match qs -p {path}
match quickshell -p {path}
match qs --path {path}
match quickshell --path {path}
